 w York City in search of his father\, Buddy discovers that being an elf in
  the big city is a little more complicated than he expected. Along the way
 \, he brings his unstoppable Christmas enthusiasm to everyone he meets—a
 nd reminds us that sometimes a little magic\, laughter\, and believing can
  make all the difference.🎬 One of the most beloved modern Christmas co
 medies!So grab your family\, your friends\, and maybe a little something s
 weet\, and come celebrate the season with Elf on the big screen!📅 Fr
 iday\, December 18🕖 7:00 PM🎟️ Tickets just $5!💵 Cash or card
  accepted!Christmas movie season is in full swing at the MET! 🎄❤️C
 ome for the laughs. Stay for the Christmas cheer. And remember…🍝 “
 You sit on a throne of lies!” 😉Movie: ElfShow Time: Friday\, Decembe
 r 18 at 7:00 PMRun Time: 1 hour 40 minutesRating: PGBox Office opens one h
 our before shows for in person sales. ACCESSIBILITY INFORMATIONWhen select
