 st of public safety\, shows may be postponed. Every effort will be made to
  reschedule instead of cancel.WHAT ELSE SHOULD I KNOW BEFORE ENJOYING A SH
 OW AT THE MET?The MET accepts cash\, credit\, and debit cards.
