 r their electrifying a cappella arrangements\, seamless harmonies\, and in
 fectious stage presence\, Indiana University’s premier all-male a cappel
 la group\, Another Round\, brings a performance packed with fan favorites
 \, modern hits\, timeless classics\, and seasonal cheer. Whether you’re 
 coming for the breathtaking vocal arrangements\, the hilarious stage antic
 s\, or a festive night out with family and friends\, Another Round guarant
 ees a show that will have you singing along from the very first note.This 
