BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Hamilton County Music Alliance presents 2026 Carmel Jazz Fest Holi
 day with Brenda and Blair
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261215T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261215T220000
UID:9beac6799bbee194b68b7d8a086e0060@ontaptickets.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://cdn.prod.discovery.evvnt.com/uploads/eve
 nt_image/event_image/23ab98bd-601c-4dc5-98bc-4426f77184b2.png/23ab98bd-601
 c-4dc5-98bc-4426f77184b2.png
DESCRIPTION: Hamilton County Music Alliance presents Carmel Jazz Fest Holi
 day Event at Fork + Ale in Carmel\, featuring Brenda Williams and Blair Cl
 ark together again to bring you a holiday evening to remember!Please join 
 us on December 15 from 7-10 PMBrenda Williams is a beloved vocalist and pe
 rformer whose powerful voice\, magnetic stage presence\, and versatile art
 istry have made her a cornerstone of the Indianapolis arts and music scene
  for decades. Brenda’s expansive repertoire spans genres—jazz\, gospel
 \, cabaret\, Motown\, country\, and musical theater—reflecting a chamele
 onic ability to adapt to any stage or sound. Her talents have taken her ac
 ross the globe. Brenda Williams doesn’t just sing songs—she transforms
  them into moments. She doesn’t just perform—she uplifts.Blair Clark i
 s a prolific recording artist\, producer\, jazz/R&amp\;B vocalist and song
 writer. Clark has performed in the United States\, Europe\, and Asia. He h
 as had the privilege of working with Grammy award-winner/producer Narada M
 ichael Walden\, BMI ® award-winner Preston Glass and New Orleans jazz leg
 end Henry Butler\, to name a few. He’s enjoyed collaborating and recordi
 ng with Evelyn “Champagne” King and Ron Tyson of The Temptations. As a
  songwriter\, Clark has written for various artists including co-writing w
 ith Narada Michael Walden and Preston Glass\, as well as his own projects.
  A producer\, Clark has created and worked in studios in Los Angeles\, San
  Francisco\, Chicago and Indianapolis.
GEO:39.97579;-86.1288108
LOCATION:Fork + Ale House - Kitchen x Brewery\, 350 Veterans Way\, Carmel
 \, 46032
URL:https://event.ontaptickets.com/events/hamilton-county-music-alliance-p
 resents-2026-carmel-jazz-fest-holiday-with-brenda-and-blair-246529
X-SOURCE:On Tap Tickets
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ontaptickets.com/event-calendar.html
END:VEVENT
